{"id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language.md","title":"Language and Standard Structure of Bounded Arithmetic","display":"df-bounded-arithmetic-language — Language and Standard Structure of Bounded Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","aliases":["72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language"],"display":"df-bounded-arithmetic-language — Language and Standard Structure of Bounded Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-language]]","[[72-df-first-order-formula]]","[[72-df-free-variable]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","[[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1; §1.3.3","source_printed_pages":"81–82, 99","source_pdf_pages":"93–94, 111","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-arithmetic-language — Language and Standard Structure of Bounded Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"111292e5b427d35c\" href=\"?note=111292e5b427d35c\" title=\"72-df-first-order-language\">72-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c943d760d42086b\" href=\"?note=2c943d760d42086b\" title=\"72-df-first-order-formula\">72-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdc2c33e939db2f8\" href=\"?note=fdc2c33e939db2f8\" title=\"72-df-free-variable\">72-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" href=\"?note=c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" title=\"72-df-finite-sequence-proof\">72-df-finite-sequence-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1; §1.3.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"81–82, 99"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"93–94, 111"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>非逻辑符号采用互异且不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 的固定符号标签。语言与基本语法取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"111292e5b427d35c\" href=\"?note=111292e5b427d35c\" title=\"72-df-first-order-language\">72-df-first-order-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2c943d760d42086b\" href=\"?note=2c943d760d42086b\" title=\"72-df-first-order-formula\">72-df-first-order-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L,\\operatorname{FV}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L,\\operatorname{FV}_L\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fdc2c33e939db2f8\" href=\"?note=fdc2c33e939db2f8\" title=\"72-df-free-variable\">72-df-free-variable</a>。对象公式位置的印刷等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=\">\\(=\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span> 为基本语法，其他联结词是下式的宏，不是演算扩充语法的独立节点。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\">\\(L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(A,B,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k,r,j_0,\\ldots,j_{r-1}\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m,k,r,j_0,\\ldots,j_{r-1}\\in\\omega\\)</span>。符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\">\\(s:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\)</span> 专用于下式的smash解释；公式宏 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\ne u\">\\(t\\ne u\\)</span> 不以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 兼作项变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\operatorname{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}\\)</span>、项解释及满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>，并限制到基本语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(L)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_L\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_L\\varphi\\)</span> 的证明系统明确取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" href=\"?note=c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" title=\"72-df-finite-sequence-proof\">72-df-finite-sequence-proof</a> 的含相等公理的有限Hilbert系统；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 已指定时省略下标。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^r\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^r\\)</span> 的分量互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n\\in\\omega^r\">\\(\\vec n\\in\\omega^r\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\)</span>。记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\vec n]\">\\(\\varphi[\\vec n]\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^{\\mathcal N_L}(\\vec n)\">\\(t^{\\mathcal N_L}(\\vec n)\\)</span> 中的变量表是这个显式参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span>；未列变量赋值为零。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_L\">\\(\\mathcal N_L\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 时分别指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>标准解释显示式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle n\\rangle,\\langle n,m\\rangle\">\\(\\langle n\\rangle,\\langle n,m\\rangle\\)</span> 作为函数或关系的参数时，分别是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,2\">\\(1,2\\)</span> 的有限函数序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_C,I_F,I_R\">\\(I_C,I_F,I_R\\)</span> 的图元素使用有序对。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle 0,0\\rangle\\in I_C\">\\(\\langle 0,0\\rangle\\in I_C\\)</span> 的第一分量是常元符号，第二分量是自然数零。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR&amp;:=\\{\\leq\\},&amp;C&amp;:=\\{0\\},&amp; F_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\{S,+,\\cdot\\},\\\\\nF_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=F_{\\mathrm A}\\cup\\{|\\cdot|,\\lfloor\\cdot/2\\rfloor,\\#\\},\\\\\na_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\{\\langle S,1\\rangle,\\langle+,2\\rangle,\\langle\\cdot,2\\rangle,\n\\langle|\\cdot|,1\\rangle,\\langle\\lfloor\\cdot/2\\rfloor,1\\rangle,\\langle\\#,2\\rangle,\\langle\\leq,2\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\langle R,F_{\\mathrm{BA}},C,a_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\langle R,F_{\\mathrm A},C,a_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\restriction(R\\cup F_{\\mathrm A})\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR&amp;:=\\{\\leq\\},&amp;C&amp;:=\\{0\\},&amp; F_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\{S,+,\\cdot\\},\\\\\nF_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=F_{\\mathrm A}\\cup\\{|\\cdot|,\\lfloor\\cdot/2\\rfloor,\\#\\},\\\\\na_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\{\\langle S,1\\rangle,\\langle+,2\\rangle,\\langle\\cdot,2\\rangle,\n\\langle|\\cdot|,1\\rangle,\\langle\\lfloor\\cdot/2\\rfloor,1\\rangle,\\langle\\#,2\\rangle,\\langle\\leq,2\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\langle R,F_{\\mathrm{BA}},C,a_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\langle R,F_{\\mathrm A},C,a_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\restriction(R\\cup F_{\\mathrm A})\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h(n):=\\max\\{k\\in\\omega:2k\\leq n\\},\\qquad\n\\lambda(n):=\\min\\{k\\in\\omega:n&lt;2^k\\},\\qquad\ns(n,m):=2^{\\lambda(n)\\lambda(m)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h(n):=\\max\\{k\\in\\omega:2k\\leq n\\},\\qquad\n\\lambda(n):=\\min\\{k\\in\\omega:n&lt;2^k\\},\\qquad\ns(n,m):=2^{\\lambda(n)\\lambda(m)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle 0,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_F&amp;:=\\{\\langle S,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto n+1)\\rangle,\\langle +,(\\langle n,m\\rangle\\mapsto n+m)\\rangle,\\langle\\cdot,(\\langle n,m\\rangle\\mapsto nm)\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\langle|\\cdot|,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto\\lambda(n))\\rangle,\\langle\\lfloor\\cdot/2\\rfloor,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto h(n))\\rangle,\\langle\\#,(\\langle n,m\\rangle\\mapsto s(n,m))\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_R&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\leq,\\{\\langle n,m\\rangle\\in\\omega^2:n\\leq m\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\langle\\omega,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}:=\\langle\\omega,I_C,I_F\\restriction F_{\\mathrm A},I_R\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle 0,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_F&amp;:=\\{\\langle S,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto n+1)\\rangle,\\langle +,(\\langle n,m\\rangle\\mapsto n+m)\\rangle,\\langle\\cdot,(\\langle n,m\\rangle\\mapsto nm)\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\langle|\\cdot|,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto\\lambda(n))\\rangle,\\langle\\lfloor\\cdot/2\\rfloor,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto h(n))\\rangle,\\langle\\#,(\\langle n,m\\rangle\\mapsto s(n,m))\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_R&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\leq,\\{\\langle n,m\\rangle\\in\\omega^2:n\\leq m\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\langle\\omega,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}:=\\langle\\omega,I_C,I_F\\restriction F_{\\mathrm A},I_R\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}(L):=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L):\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}(L):=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L):\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\{v_{j_0},\\ldots,v_{j_{r-1}}\\}\\land\nj_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;j_{r-1}\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_L(\\varphi):=\\forall v_{j_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{j_{r-1}}\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\{v_{j_0},\\ldots,v_{j_{r-1}}\\}\\land\nj_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;j_{r-1}\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_L(\\varphi):=\\forall v_{j_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{j_{r-1}}\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(\\neg A\\lor\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\to B:=\\neg A\\lor B,\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists x A:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B:=\\neg(\\neg A\\lor\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\to B:=\\neg A\\lor B,\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists x A:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},&amp;\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}},&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}},&amp;\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},&amp;\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}},&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}},&amp;\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\ne u:=\\neg(t\\doteq u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\ne u:=\\neg(t\\doteq u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu_{\\vec x,\\vec n}&amp;:=\\{\\langle x_i,n_i\\rangle:i&lt;r\\}\\cup\\{\\langle y,0\\rangle:y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal N_L\\models\\varphi[\\vec n]&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal N_L,\\nu_{\\vec x,\\vec n}\\models\\varphi,\\\\\nt^{\\mathcal N_L}(\\vec n)&amp;:=⟦ t⟧_{\\mathcal N_L,\\nu_{\\vec x,\\vec n}},\\\\\nT\\vdash_L\\varphi&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash_L^=\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu_{\\vec x,\\vec n}&amp;:=\\{\\langle x_i,n_i\\rangle:i&lt;r\\}\\cup\\{\\langle y,0\\rangle:y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal N_L\\models\\varphi[\\vec n]&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal N_L,\\nu_{\\vec x,\\vec n}\\models\\varphi,\\\\\nt^{\\mathcal N_L}(\\vec n)&amp;:=⟦ t⟧_{\\mathcal N_L,\\nu_{\\vec x,\\vec n}},\\\\\nT\\vdash_L\\varphi&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash_L^=\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>语言及标准函数解释保留原数学内容；λ(0)=0，λ在正自然数上给出二进制位数，h给出向下取半，smash取2的两位数乘积次幂。指数只用于元理论标准解释，不被加入对象语言。标准结构、赋值、句法闭包及含相等的可证性均已在前两节或72内部显式依赖中指定。原有关于已读取外部第58本书文件的叙述不能由本次提供材料核实，本次仅按调用接口重建缺失内容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"111292e5b427d35c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2c943d760d42086b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"fdc2c33e939db2f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-sequence-proof","status":"resolved","id":"c42b7f1faaf95a1c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]]","embed":false},{"ta