\mathrm A}\\cup\\{|\\cdot|,\\lfloor\\cdot/2\\rfloor,\\#\\},\\\\\na_{\\mathrm{BA}}&:=\\{\\langle S,1\\rangle,\\langle+,2\\rangle,\\langle\\cdot,2\\rangle,\n\\langle|\\cdot|,1\\rangle,\\langle\\lfloor\\cdot/2\\rfloor,1\\rangle,\\langle\\#,2\\rangle,\\langle\\leq,2\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}&:=\\langle R,F_{\\mathrm{BA}},C,a_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}&:=\\langle R,F_{\\mathrm A},C,a_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\restriction(R\\cup F_{\\mathrm A})\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"h(n):=\\max\\{k\\in\\omega:2k\\leq n\\},\\qquad\n\\lambda(n):=\\min\\{k\\in\\omega:n<2^k\\},\\qquad\ns(n,m):=2^{\\lambda(n)\\lambda(m)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nI_C&:=\\{\\langle 0,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_F&:=\\{\\langle S,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto n+1)\\rangle,\\langle +,(\\langle n,m\\rangle\\mapsto n+m)\\rangle,\\langle\\cdot,(\\langle n,m\\rangle\\mapsto nm)\\rangle,\\\\\n&\\qquad\\langle|\\cdot|,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto\\lambda(n))\\rangle,\\langle\\lfloor\\cdot/2\\rfloor,(\\langle n\\rangle\\mapsto h(n))\\rangle,\\langle\\#,(\\langle n,m\\rangle\\mapsto s(n,m))\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_R&:=\\{\\langle\\leq,\\{\\langle n,m\\rangle\\in\\omega^2:n\\leq m\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}&:=\\langle\\omega,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}:=\\langle\\omega,I_C,I_F\\restriction F_{\\mathrm A},I_R\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}(L):=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L):\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\{v_{j_0},\\ldots,v_{j_{r-1}}\\}\\land\nj_0<\\cdots<j_{r-1}\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_L(\\varphi):=\\forall v_{j_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{j_{r-1}}\\varphi.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\land B:=\\neg(\\neg A\\lor\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\to B:=\\neg A\\lor B,\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists x A:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm A}&:=\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},&\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm A}&:=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},&\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}&:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&:=\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}},&\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&:=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}},&\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&:=\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"t\\ne u:=\\neg(t\\doteq u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu_{\\vec x,\\vec n}&:=\\{\\langle x_i,n_i\\rangle:i<r\\}\\cup\\{\\langle y,0\\rangle:y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal N_L\\models\\varphi[\\vec n]&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal N_L,\\nu_{\\vec x,\\vec n}\\models\\varphi,\\\\\nt^{\\mathcal N_L}(\\vec n)&:=⟦ t⟧_{\\mathcal N_L,\\nu_{\\vec x,\\vec n}},\\\\\nT\\vdash_L\\varphi&:\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash_L^=\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6261,"backlinks":[{"id":"f08305bb0d508a7d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 及 $\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]；$a:=v_0,b:=v_1,c:=v_2,d:=v_3$ 是四个固定互异的对象变量。"},{"id":"a8a8a9d3352a4c4f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]] 的 $\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}$。$\\mathbf2$ 由下式引入；$\\lambda(n)=\\min\\{k:n<2^k\\}$ 为已定义的数值位长，$\\lambda(0)=0$。"},{"id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}$；$\\mathcal F_L=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)$、$\\mathcal A_L=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L)$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]] 的一阶语法。"},{"id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"